Subject: [PATCH 2/2] viewer2: the Fronts view's data and web copies (build
 step only; the view itself is not in yet)

tools/fronts.json lists the display disp-3-4 and the six fascias, each a
"final candidate" except K4W411, "approved", with captions from the write-ups
and light colours; tools/fronts.py makes WebP copies (2400 px at most, under
480 kB, plus 1200 px cards) of the PCB/art PNGs into site/ only and writes
data/fronts.json. build.sh runs it and now holds one publish to 64 MB and 255
files. The page's Fronts tab and its tests are not applied: the page update is
on hold.

